 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:BEGIN ClusterHudScreenMode -->
 <!-- CARROT:REVIEW reviewed-for="" -->
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN BEHAVIOR -->
+### Behavior
+
+In 3D views, the road and adjacent vehicles fill the screen, with speed and driving assist status at the edges. Road-camera view uses the default layout. Onroad P/R prioritizes parking and reverse screens.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END BEHAVIOR -->
+
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:BEGIN USAGE -->
+### Usage
+
+Select Surround in External HUD Screen Mode. Select Light for day or Dark for night in External HUD Theme. Auto uses the day view from 06:00 until 18:00 device local time.
+<!-- CARROT:SECTION:END USAGE -->
+
 <!-- CARROT:MANUAL:END ClusterHudScreenMode -->
